      "category": "Concentration",
      "severity": 4,
      "score_rationale": "Note 4/5 : premier risque de la section Strategic and Operational Risks, haut de l'Item 1A. Exposition chiffree : la cohorte AI-native \"represented approximately seven percentage points of our year-over-year revenue growth\" et inclut le plus gros client, avec optimisation d'usage explicite. Langage fort (\"would be harmed\") mais exposition inferieure au seuil critique.",
